{"html": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/f004026bdc70b55b7261091615f7ce6a.poster.avif?t=1761404108\" width=616 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/f004026bdc70b55b7261091615f7ce6a.webm?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/f004026bdc70b55b7261091615f7ce6a.mp4?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CloverPit é a cria diabólica de Balatro e Buckshot Roulette que prende os jogadores num inferno que eles mesmos criaram. Trancado numa cela caindo aos pedaços com uma máquina caça-níqueis e um caixa eletrônico, você precisa pagar sua dívida no fim de cada rodada ou, literalmente, desmoronar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/fc21727208b408fba84394c258009881.poster.avif?t=1761404108\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/fc21727208b408fba84394c258009881.webm?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/fc21727208b408fba84394c258009881.mp4?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipule a máquina caça-níqueis para ganhar moedas extras e faça o possível para se dar bem com vários prêmios e amuletos que desencadeiam combos gigantescos e ainda se acumulam, resultando numa partida de sucesso. Quebre as regras, leve vantagem e pague seu sequestrador pelo máximo de tempo que conseguir para tentar se livrar do cativeiro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/b4d874835c57429b13bcab5dcaf418fb.poster.avif?t=1761404108\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/b4d874835c57429b13bcab5dcaf418fb.webm?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Características do jogo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/9d249bbcc27933a6af668c22b73e2a72.poster.avif?t=1761404108\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/9d249bbcc27933a6af668c22b73e2a72.webm?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Um roguelite cativante em que cada rodada pode ser a última!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/cec578e7e3897751afc1b7b30e6bff30.webp?t=1761404108\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/cec578e7e3897751afc1b7b30e6bff30.poster.avif?t=1761404108\" class=\"bb_img\" width=14 height=14 /></picture></span>Rejogabilidade, diversos finais e potencializadores desbloqueáveis!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/08b01e6eab6d0ad58dc0b6084fa383cc.poster.avif?t=1761404108\" width=14 height=14 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/08b01e6eab6d0ad58dc0b6084fa383cc.webm?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Eleve sua pontuação ao infinito e além no Modo Infinito!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/3f49711e8df2a0b90546a4b11e830900.poster.avif?t=1761404108\" width=14 height=14 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/3f49711e8df2a0b90546a4b11e830900.webm?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Atmosfera sufocante semelhante a de um escape room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/d35d5a336ba83642d80c3e7be107eae8.poster.avif?t=1761404108\" width=14 height=14 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/d35d5a336ba83642d80c3e7be107eae8.webm?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Mais de 150 itens e sinergias para aumentar sua sorte!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/b0f1444f444ecf27b60109ae0c70f4c1.poster.avif?t=1761404108\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/b0f1444f444ecf27b60109ae0c70f4c1.webm?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Uma história assustadora sobre vício e fuga!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DÚVIDA: É UM JOGO DE APOSTAS?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Não mesmo! CloverPit é roguelite de terror, e não um simulador de caça-níqueis. Nossa máquina caça-níqueis é feita para ser quebrada e derrotada e nunca vai pedir dinheiro de verdade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/3cbf9fcfd36b04437fa8da2f662e6adc.poster.avif?t=1761404108\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/3cbf9fcfd36b04437fa8da2f662e6adc.webm?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314790/extras/3cbf9fcfd36b04437fa8da2f662e6adc.mp4?t=1761404108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>"}